                            <h2 class="title" id="overview_heading">Overview</h2>
                            <h2>"Be 3D": Event Marketing for a Standout Development Company</h2>
<p><span data-sheets-value="{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Lithium came to us with a simple ask: come up with a theme for their annual developer\u2019s conference that would energize their internal teams. \n\nOur Be 3D was a success far beyond this original scope\u2014weaving its way into the company\u2019s business strategy and messaging company-wide.\n\nwww.lithium.com/be3d&quot;}" data-sheets-userformat="{&quot;2&quot;:897,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0}">Software developer Lithium (now Khoros) needed help coming up with a theme that would energize its internal teams at an upcoming annual conference. Through a combination of strategic and creative work, we developed a concept based around the fact that customers are more than just data points—they are people, with concrete wants and needs.</span></p>
<p>We captured the resulting theme—"Be 3D"—in a short video, tailor-made to inspire the company's employees. The idea made for a successful, memorable conference, and stuck around to play a role in the company's ongoing business strategy and messaging.</p>
<div class="hs-embed-wrapper" data-service="vimeo" data-responsive="true" style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 0; max-width: 640px; max-height: 360px; min-width: 256px; display: block; margin: auto;"><div class="hs-embed-content-wrapper"><div style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 56.25%; margin: 0px;"><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/298715100?app_id=122963" width="640" height="360" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen="" title="Lithium Technologies &amp;ldquo;Be 3D&amp;quot; Campaign Video." style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;"></iframe></div></div></div>
                        
                        

                        


                        


                        


                        

                        
                        
